[I] Papirus icon theme

[T] Papirus is a free and open source SVG icon theme for Linux, based on the
[T] Paper icon set with many new icons and extras. It comes in several
[T] variants, such as Papirus, Papirus-Dark and Papirus-Light.

[U] https://github.com/PapirusDevelopmentTeam/papirus-icon-theme

